  "appliesTo": "Commercial applicators/pesticide businesses; private applicators for each application required under paragraph (E), primarily RUP agricultural applications.",
  "verification": "researched",
  "notes": "Commercial excluding categories 7/10 includes weather when applicable. Private records include applicator name/license, brand/product and EPA number, total amount, location/field number, total area/acreage, crop, and date. Records created on date of application; some customer-copy rules apply. 2026-09-24 primary-text audit: OAC 901:5-11-02: private applicators “Shall record the following information for each application on the date of application” — same day. Commercial ag categories give the customer a copy within thirty days unless requested sooner or waived; private applicators give the landowner a copy within 30 days of a request. Private records cover restricted-use pesticides plus general-use pesticides applied under the ORC 921.26(D) exemption, so the full private list stays. No sky element.",
